msgstr "Bir daqiqada sahifalar, har bir tarmoq uchun"

msgid "A /24 network for IPv4 or a /64 for IPv6: what a scraper gets when it rotates addresses next to each other."
msgstr "IPv4 uchun /24 tarmoq yoki IPv6 uchun /64: scraper yonma-yon manzillarni almashtirib ishlatganda oladigan narsa."

